---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="CV — Ayach Youssef"
  description="CV of Ayach Youssef, software engineer focused on backend & DevOps: OneBotAds (production SaaS), Jobistart, Digitalye, FST Settat. Print this page for a PDF copy."
>
  <section class="study-head container cv-tools">
    <p class="eyebrow">Curriculum vitae — always current</p>
    <h1 class="display">CV</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This page is the single source of truth — the PDF is whatever this page
      says today. Press the button (or Ctrl+P) and save as PDF for a clean
      one-page copy.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions" style="margin-top: var(--space-6)">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="window.print()"
        >Print / save as PDF</button
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cv-sheet-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cv-sheet">
        <header class="cv-head">
          <div>
            <h2 class="display cv-name">Ayach Youssef</h2>
            <p class="cv-role">Software Engineer — Backend &amp; DevOps</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="cv-contact">
            <li>
              <a href="mailto:ayach.you.fst@uhp.ac.ma"
                >ayach.you.fst@uhp.ac.ma</a
              >
            </li>
            <li>+212 698 869 977</li>
            <li>Berrechid, Morocco</li>
            <li><a href="https://ayach.is-a.dev">ayach.is-a.dev</a></li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://github.com/YoussefAyach01"
                >github.com/YoussefAyach01</a
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/youssefayach"
                >linkedin.com/in/youssefayach</a
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </header>

        <div class="cv-section">
          <h3 class="cv-h">Profile</h3>
          <p>
            Backend-focused engineer who also shipped the frontend end to end:
            took a SaaS product from a click-through mockup to production in
            three months, and deployed and operated it myself — six ad-platform
            integrations, an LLM agent on isolated MCP tool servers, a 17-table
            PostgreSQL backend, all running on a Linux VPS behind nginx and PM2.
            I learn fast, and I ship.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cv-section">
          <h3 class="cv-h">Experience</h3>
          <div class="cv-item">
            <div class="cv-item-head">
              <strong>Full-Stack / DevOps Intern (PFE) — Jobistart</strong>
              <span class="cv-date">Apr 2026 — present</span>
            </div>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Deployed and operate the product on a Linux VPS (PM2, nginx);
                shipped to production June 23, 2026; delivered complete handoff
                documentation (schema, API reference, deployment runbook).
              </li>
              <li>
                Built the entire backend of OneBotAds, an AI ad-automation SaaS,
                from zero: PostgreSQL schema (17 tables), ~35 REST route groups,
                ~29 services (Node.js/Express, Sequelize).
              </li>
              <li>
                Integrated six ad platforms (Meta, TikTok, Google Ads, Snapchat,
                LinkedIn, Taboola): full OAuth 2.0 flows, campaign CRUD,
                per-platform token-refresh service.
              </li>
              <li>
                Designed the AI campaign agent: LLM orchestrating six MCP tool
                servers spawned per-request with credential isolation; plus a
                cron rule engine and Shopify→UTM→ROAS attribution pipeline.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-item">
            <div class="cv-item-head">
              <strong
                >Front-End Developer (part-time, remote) — Digitalye</strong
              >
              <span class="cv-date">2025</span>
            </div>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Built and maintained React interfaces for client projects
                alongside my studies.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cv-section">
          <h3 class="cv-h">Education</h3>
          <div class="cv-item">
            <div class="cv-item-head">
              <strong
                >Licence ST — Computer Engineering (LSGI), FST Settat</strong
              >
              <span class="cv-date">2025 — present</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-item">
            <div class="cv-item-head">
              <strong
                >DEUST — Mathematics, CS &amp; Physics (MIP), FST Settat</strong
              >
              <span class="cv-date">2023 — 2025</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cv-item">
            <div class="cv-item-head">
              <strong>Baccalaureate — Science track, mention Good</strong>
              <span class="cv-date">2023</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cv-section cv-cols">
          <div>
            <h3 class="cv-h">Skills</h3>
            <p class="cv-skills">
              <strong>Infrastructure &amp; DevOps:</strong> Linux, Docker, nginx,
              PM2, GitHub Actions (CI/CD), Git, DNS/DHCP, VLAN/WAN<br />
              <strong>Languages:</strong> JavaScript/TypeScript, Python, Java, C,
              PHP, SQL/PL-SQL, Bash<br />
              <strong>Web:</strong> React, Node.js/Express, Sequelize, REST, OAuth
              2.0, Stripe, Astro<br />
              <strong>Data &amp; AI:</strong> PostgreSQL, Oracle, MySQL, MCP servers,
              LLM agents
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="cv-h">Languages</h3>
            <p class="cv-skills">
              Arabic — native<br />
              French — fluent<br />
              English — professional
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="cv-footer-note">
          Full case studies and engineering notes: <a
            href="https://ayach.is-a.dev">ayach.is-a.dev</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .cv-sheet {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-12);
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .cv-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .cv-name {
    font-size: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .cv-role {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
  }
  .cv-contact {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: right;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .cv-contact a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .cv-contact a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .cv-section {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }
  .cv-h {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .cv-item {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .cv-item-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .cv-date {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .cv-item ul {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  .cv-item li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }
  .cv-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }
  .cv-skills {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .cv-footer-note {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cv-sheet {
      padding: var(--space-6);
    }
    .cv-contact {
      text-align: left;
    }
    .cv-cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-4);
    }
  }

  /* ---------- Print: exactly one clean A4 page ---------- */
  @media print {
    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 12mm;
    }
    .cv-sheet {
      border: none;
      border-radius: 0;
      padding: 0;
      max-width: none;
    }
    .cv-name {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
    }
    .cv-section {
      margin-top: 5mm;
    }
    .cv-item ul {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
    .cv-skills {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .cv-contact {
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .cv-sheet-wrap {
      padding: 0;
      border: none;
    }
    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }
  }
</style>
